  assistant: The bug described is due to the guardrail wrapping only checking the absolute last user message for text or image content, but after a tool execution, the last message is a tool result without text/image content. This causes the guardrail wrapping to be lost.

I have applied the fix in the `_format_bedrock_messages` method in `src/strands/models/bedrock.py` where we now precompute the index of the last user message containing text or image content and use that index to apply the wrapping. Thi...
